[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0449","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0449.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0416","title":"NTMail 5.x 代理限制绕过漏洞","description":"NTMail 5.x 存在安全绕过漏洞，网络用户可通过将请求重定向至 NTMail 的 Web 配置服务器，绕过代理限制规则。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用该漏洞，通过网络访问即可实施攻击，利用复杂度低。该漏洞仅影响系统完整性，不涉及机密性和可用性，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。受影响版本为 NTMail 5.x 系列。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0416"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:40Z","remediation":"NTMail 5.x 已停止维护，建议立即升级至 Gordano 后续受支持版本或迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器产品。如无法升级，可在防火墙上限制对 NTMail Web 配置服务端口（默认 80/443）的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并配置代理规则严格过滤重定向请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.gordano.com/support/archives/ntmail/2000-05/00001114.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1196","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NABBJLKKPKIHDIMKFKGCMEFANMAB.georger%40nls.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0416.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0416","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0416.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0416.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-34f7-g82v-435m/GHSA-34f7-g82v-435m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0416.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0449.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0449.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0449.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0379","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0379.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0457","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 .HTR 文件片段读取漏洞","description":"微软 IIS 4.0/5.0 的 ISM.DLL 模块存在文件名处理漏洞，攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含大量编码空格（%20）的文件名请求并以 .htr 扩展名结尾，利用服务器错误解析触发文件碎片读取，导致读取目标系统中的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 IIS 4.0 和 5.0 服务，支持远程非认证攻击，存在较低的利用难度，可直接导致系统文件泄露，甚至为进一步攻击提供信息支持。微软已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0457"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"升级到Microsoft IIS 6.0或更高版本，应用安全补丁并关闭.htr文件扩展处理。修改IIS元数据库配置，禁用向文件请求附加.htr扩展名的验证功能，并确保已安装最新的安全性更新。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙规则阻止对.htr扩展名的请求流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95810120719608&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1193","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-031","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4448","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19908","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0457.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0457.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0457","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0457.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0457.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w5j6-fmxr-5fr8/GHSA-w5j6-fmxr-5fr8.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0457.yaml","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0457.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0379.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0335","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0335.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0408","title":"微软 IIS 4.0/5.0 文件扩展拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 存在 URL 恶意文件扩展名解析漏洞，攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含大量文件扩展名的超长复杂 URL 触发该漏洞，导致 IIS 服务崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 IIS 4.0/5.0 的 Windows 2000/XP/2003 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过精心构造的恶意 URL 耗尽服务器资源，使 IIS 托管的网站服务完全不可用，用户无法正常访问 Web 服务。该漏洞源于 IIS 对 URL 中文件扩展名解析逻辑存在缺陷，无法正确处理异常长度的扩展名序列，导致服务进程异常终止。攻击者只需发送单个恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发拒绝服务，攻击门槛低、危害大，建议立即升级至 IIS 5.0 SP1 或更高版本，或安装微软安全公告 MS00-057 提供的补丁程序（KB269862）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0408"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 IIS 至 5.0 SP1 或更高版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-057 提供的补丁程序（KB269862）。若暂无法升级，可在 IIS 服务器前部署 WAF 或应用层防火墙，配置规则拦截包含异常长文件扩展名的恶意 URL 请求（如包含大量连续点号或扩展名的请求），同时在 IIS 中禁用不必要的脚本映射扩展名以减少攻击面。建议同时在防火墙层面限制非必要的外部访问 IIS 管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=260205","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1190","http://www.ussrback.com/labs40.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-030","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19907","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0408.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0408.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0408","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0408.rules","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0408.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0408.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wx3j-8h4r-qj57/GHSA-wx3j-8h4r-qj57.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0408.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/iis_dos_ussrback.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0335.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0335.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0335.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0439","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0439.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0410","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.5.1 文件缓存拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.5.1 的文件缓存组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送大量针对 CFCACHE 标签缓存文件的重复请求，由于这些缓存文件未被存储在内存中，导致服务器资源被耗尽，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可触发，影响 ColdFusion Server 4.5.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0410"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39Z","remediation":"升级 ColdFusion Server 至 4.5.2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 ColdFusion 管理后台禁用 CFCACHE 标签缓存功能，或限制对缓存文件的直接 HTTP 访问（通过 Web 服务器 URL 重写规则拦截对缓存目录的请求）。鉴于该产品已极为老旧，建议迁移至受支持的 Adobe ColdFusion 现代版本（2016/2021/2023）或替代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0005&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=4843","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1192","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0410.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0410","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0410.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0410.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xm2m-chg4-j873/GHSA-xm2m-chg4-j873.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0410.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001363.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0439.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0439.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0436","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0436.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0406","title":"Netscape Navigator 和 Communicator 无效SSL证书警告旁路漏洞","description":"Netscape Navigator 4.07 及 Communicator 4.73 之前版本存在 SSL 证书验证缺陷，未能正确校验 SSL 证书有效性。远程攻击者可利用该漏洞将合法 Web 服务器的流量重定向至恶意服务器，实施中间人攻击窃取用户敏感信息，被称为 \"Acros-Suencksen SSL\" 漏洞。影响范围为 Netscape Navigator 4.07 及 Communicator 4.73 前版本，攻击条件需诱导用户访问恶意站点或实施中间人劫持，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0406"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Netscape Communicator 4.73 或 Navigator 4.07 及以上版本，可从 Netscape 官网下载最新版本安装包覆盖安装。如无法立即升级，建议暂停使用 Netscape 访问 HTTPS 站点，改用已修复 SSL 证书验证漏洞的其他浏览器（如 IE 5.0+）访问敏感站点，并避免在不可信网络环境下进行敏感操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.acrossecurity.com/aspr/ASPR-2000-04-06-1-PUB.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-05.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-028.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1188","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0406.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0406","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0406.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0406.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4x6c-6ppx-5vjq/GHSA-4x6c-6ppx-5vjq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--668846a1-1d8a-4754-aa60-214b2c110902.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0406.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001361.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0436.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0339","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0411","title":"Matt Wright FormMail CGI 环境变量泄露漏洞","description":"Matt Wright FormMail CGI 脚本 1.6/1.7/1.8 版本存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 env_report 参数发送特制请求，无需身份认证即可获取服务器环境变量（如系统路径、配置文件路径等敏感信息），导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞影响 FormMail 1.6、1.7 及 1.8 版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用。官方已停止维护，建议用户迁移至替代方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0411"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 Matt Wright FormMail 至 1.9 或更高版本，该版本已移除 env_report 参数功能。如无法升级，直接删除或禁用 FormMail CGI 脚本，改用更安全的现代表单处理方案（如支持输入验证的 Perl/PHP 邮件脚本）。同时确保 CGI 目录权限设置为 755，避免其他环境变量泄露。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 服务器配置中拒绝包含 env_report 参数的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0125.html","http://www.perfectotech.com/blackwatchlabs/vul5_10.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1187","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19906","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0411.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0411","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0411.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0411.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gggj-8j7g-cpwh/GHSA-gggj-8j7g-cpwh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0411.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001364.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0339.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0339.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0338","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0338.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0409","title":"Netscape Communicator 证书导入符号链接漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.73 及更早版本在导入新证书时存在符号链接跟随漏洞。当用户导入证书时，程序会以不安全的方式操作 /tmp 目录下的临时文件，本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下预先创建符号链接，指向目标用户的可写文件，诱使目标用户导入证书从而触发该漏洞，导致攻击者可以覆盖目标用户的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.5 至 4.73 版本，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低，攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限及用户交互。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0409"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Netscape Communicator 4.74 或更高版本，该版本已修复导入证书时跟随符号链接的问题。由于 Netscape 产品线已停止维护，建议迁移至 Mozilla Firefox 或 Google Chrome 等现代浏览器。临时缓解措施：在导入证书前手动清理 /tmp 目录中的可疑符号链接，或以非特权用户身份执行证书导入操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0126.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1201","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19912","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0409.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0409","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0409.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0409.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m59v-mjv4-379q/GHSA-m59v-mjv4-379q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0409.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0b1c6b3d-7e35-422f-9389-2acc12a3e523.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--0b1c6b3d-7e35-422f-9389-2acc12a3e523.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0338.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0295","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0304","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 HTR请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及 5.0 版本中，当安装了 IISADMPWD 虚拟目录时，inetinfo.exe 程序对畸形的 HTR 请求存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的未分隔（Undelimited）HTR 请求，触发 inetinfo.exe 进程崩溃，导致 IIS 服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT/2000 平台上的 IIS 4.0 和 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。微软已发布安全公告 MS00-028 修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0304"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS00-031 补丁包，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。若无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中删除 IISADMPWD 虚拟目录映射，或禁用 .htr 脚本映射以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1191","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise52.php3","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-031","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0304.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0304.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0304","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0304.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0304.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7qq3-2c7j-qq7w/GHSA-7qq3-2c7j-qq7w.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-iis.rules","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0304.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0304.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0295.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0407","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0387","title":"FreeBSD golddig 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"FreeBSD Ports Collection 中的 golddig 游戏所包含的 makelev 程序存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击等方式，利用该程序在处理文件时未充分验证路径的缺陷，以游戏运行权限覆盖系统任意文件，导致本地数据完整性受损。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，但需要本地用户权限。受影响系统为运行 golddig 游戏的 FreeBSD 系统。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0387"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36Z","remediation":"删除 golddig 游戏包中 makelev 程序的 setuid 位：`chmod u-s /usr/local/bin/makelev`；如非必要，直接卸载 golddig 包：`pkg_delete golddig` 或 `pkg remove golddig`。升级 FreeBSD ports 至包含修复的版本，或从 ports 中移除 golddig 游戏。限制本地非授权用户对 makelev 的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0387.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0387","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0387.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0387.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4jg2-rc77-pvcj/GHSA-4jg2-rc77-pvcj.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0387.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001359.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6238c6be-e443-4cf6-a380-65919bf8f8b7.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0401","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0383","title":"AOL Instant Messenger 文件传输路径泄露漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）的文件传输组件存在路径信息泄露漏洞。当用户通过 AIM 的文件传输功能发送文件时，系统会将发送方本地文件系统的完整物理路径暴露给接收方。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞获取目标系统的目录结构信息，为进一步攻击收集敏感信息。该漏洞影响 AOL Instant Messenger 的多个版本，攻击者只需诱导目标发送任意文件即可触发信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0383"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36Z","remediation":"AOL Instant Messenger 已于 2017 年 12 月 15 日正式停止服务，建议立即卸载 AIM 客户端并迁移至其他受支持的即时通讯软件（如 Slack、Microsoft Teams 等）。如因历史原因必须继续使用，可在 AIM 文件传输设置中禁用\"显示文件路径\"选项，并在防火墙规则中阻止 AIM 的 TCP 端口 5190 出站连接以限制文件传输功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1180","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=002401bfb918%247310d5a0%241ef084ce%40karemor.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0383","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-52fg-2wrh-pq8q/GHSA-52fg-2wrh-pq8q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0383.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--57897d78-a338-46c3-a79a-5b94ba906271.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0398","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0382","title":"Allaire ClusterCATS URL重定向漏洞","description":"Allaire ClusterCATS 在处理 HTML 重定向时存在信息泄露漏洞，会将过期的查询字符串参数附加到重定向 URL 中，导致敏感信息（如会话令牌、认证凭据等）被泄露给第三方站点。攻击者可通过构造特制的重定向请求，诱使目标用户访问恶意站点，从而窃取 URL 中携带的敏感数据。该漏洞影响 ColdFusion ClusterCATS 相关版本，攻击复杂度较高，需用户交互配合，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0382"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Allaire 官方补丁（参考安全公告 ID 15697），该补丁修复了 ClusterCATS 在 HTML 重定向时附加过期查询字符串参数导致信息泄露的问题。由于 ColdFusion ClusterCATS 已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的 ColdFusion 版本，或在 Web 服务器层面对重定向 URL 进行参数过滤清理作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=15697&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0382.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0382","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0382.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0382.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jfh9-vp9v-wh4v/GHSA-jfh9-vp9v-wh4v.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0382.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Aries/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.898"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0318","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0384","title":"Intel NetStructure 7110 未记录账户密码漏洞","description":"Intel NetStructure 7110 和 7180 设备存在未记录的后门账户漏洞（servnow、root、wizard），其密码可通过设备的 MAC 地址推算得出。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，通过猜测密码以 root 权限登录设备，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 NetStructure 7110 及 7180 系列产品，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商未提供官方补丁，建议限制设备管理接口的网络访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0384"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36Z","remediation":"立即修改 Intel NetStructure 7110/7180 设备中 servnow、root、wizard 三个未记录账户的密码为强随机密码，避免使用与 MAC 地址相关的任何字符串；在防火墙上限制仅允许受信 IP 访问设备管理端口（Telnet/SSH/HTTP）；如业务允许，禁用未使用的 wizard 账户或将 shell 设为 /sbin/nologin；将设备置于隔离网段，避免暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://216.188.41.136/","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/ipivot7180.html","http://www.lopht.com/advisories/ipivot7110.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1182","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1183","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19904","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0384.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0384","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0384.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0384.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/939814c958d14a0bcaf2639e41afe118cdb5f74c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-765g-qxmj-pjrx/GHSA-765g-qxmj-pjrx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1182/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7dec9782-ea7f-4bc5-b055-bb8934ad2691.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0318.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0341","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0413","title":"Microsoft IIS FrontPage 服务器扩展路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 和 5.0 的 FrontPage 服务器扩展组件中的 shtml.exe 程序存在物理路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过请求一个不存在的 HTML、HTM、ASP 或 SHTML 文件，触发服务器返回包含完整物理路径的错误信息，从而获取网站根目录的真实路径。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者获取路径信息后可为进一步探测和攻击提供基础。影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 上运行 IIS 4.0/5.0 并安装 FrontPage 服务器扩展的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0413"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载或禁用 FrontPage 服务器扩展（FrontPage Server Extensions），或升级至 Windows 2000 SP2 及以上版本。如业务必须使用，应在 IIS 管理器中为 shtml.exe 配置自定义错误页面，禁止返回详细路径信息；同时限制 shtml.exe 仅允许本地或受信 IP 访问。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器上配置 URLScan 工具拦截对 shtml.exe 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0084.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1174","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19897","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0413.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0413.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0413","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0413.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0413.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/frontpage_shtml.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jx68-8j6j-8v87/GHSA-jx68-8j6j-8v87.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0413.yaml","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CTF-Repos/blob/b5364388a861fc7457409d494a9d075d73e7867e/Vulnhub/SkyTower/Web-scan.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0413.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0341.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0341.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0341.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0348","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0426","title":"UltraScripts UltraBoard 1.6 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"UltraScripts UltraBoard 1.6 及其他版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 Session 参数中引用 UltraBoard，导致 UltraBoard 进程不断 fork 出自身副本，耗尽系统进程资源，从而导致拒绝服务。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需构造包含 UltraBoard 引用的 Session 参数发送请求即可触发漏洞，导致服务器资源耗尽、服务不可用。该漏洞影响 UltraBoard 1.6 及其他版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），主要影响系统可用性。UltraScripts 官方已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0426"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 UltraBoard 1.6 到 1.8 或更高版本以获取 Session 参数验证补丁。如无法立即打补丁，请使用防火墙对管理端口进行源 IP 限制，有效降低程序异常的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0059.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1175","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19899","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0426","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0426.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0426.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6fq7-3q96-vw9x/GHSA-6fq7-3q96-vw9x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0426.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001354.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2dbce7bd-880a-4923-8153-39399e9a1deb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0344","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0344.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0423","title":"NetWin DNews 5.3 Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NetWin DNews 5.3 服务器的 DNEWSWEB CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过向 group、cmd、utag 等参数传递超长字符串触发栈溢出，进而在服务器上下文中执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 NetWin DNews 5.3 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N），主要影响系统完整性。攻击者可通过构造包含超长参数的 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行。ExploitDB 已公开远程缓冲区溢出利用代码（EDB-19895）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0423"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 NetWin DNews 服务器至 5.4 或更高版本（建议升级至最新稳定版），或联系 NetWin 官方获取 DNEWSWEB CGI 缓冲区溢出补丁补丁。若暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置 WAF 规则拦截过长的 group、cmd、utag 参数（建议限制参数长度 ≤256 字节），并在防火墙层面限制对 DNEWSWEB CGI 接口的访问来源 IP。建议同时禁用不必要的 CGI 功能模块以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95764950403250&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1172","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19895","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0423.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0423","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0423.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0423.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-998v-2qg9-284c/GHSA-998v-2qg9-284c.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0423.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1172/info.html","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0344.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0344.toml"}]